Congratulations! You have successfully transitioned to a clean **ZimaOS v0.5.1** environment on a stable Ubuntu 22.04 foundation.

## Final Configuration Summary

- **Distribution**: Ubuntu 22.04 (Fresh Install)
- **Version**: ZimaOS v0.5.1 (Beta)
- **Environment**: WSL2
- **Network**: [http://172.28.133.127](http://172.28.133.127)

## 🚀 Accessing Your Dashboard

1.  Open your browser and visit: **[http://172.28.133.127](http://172.28.133.127)**
2.  You will be greeted by the **ZimaOS Start Screen**.
3.  Click on **"Create Account"** to set up your primary username and password.

